              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चुकना (cuknā) is the intransitive partner of चुकाना, from cukk, \"fall short of, stop\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 4848), which lists Hindi cuknā, \"to be finished\"."
